                <p>Document 27.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f3" n="3" xml:id="d29-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d29-f4" n="4" xml:id="d29-f4-content">
                <p>No specific reply to telegram Repto 5477 has
                    been found in Department of State or ECA message
                    files. Riddleberger and Porter began sending detailed reports on the
                    meetings of various OEEC committees and special
                    working groups, for example, telegrams Repto
                    5502, November 1, Repto 5627, November 9,
                        Repto 5734, November 16, and Repto 5738, November 16, in ECA message files, FRC 53A278, Paris.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
